==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10.67~18.67 seconds<sup>320f~560f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 20~53.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~53.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pumpkin Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10.67~18.67 seconds<sup>320f~560f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As with [[Infernal Tower/Floor 1|Floor 1]], no particular strategy is needed. Bring a few [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] and [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] such as [[Paris Cat]] and you should be fine.

